    "title": "Fort Hood shooter's execution to be carried out by firing squad; the first in over 80 years - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editorial ,\n7 hours ago Editor's note: Trump said that the government no longer plans to live-stream the execution, but Hasan is still set to be executed by firing squad, according to NBC News. Nidal Hasan, former U.S. Army psychiatrist, is to be executed by firing squad on Dec. 3, it being the first U.S. military execution in over 60 years and the first time a firing squad has been used since World War II, according to NPR. Read full article",
